  "changes": [
    "Use the shared cancellable input reader for every 3D format; discard obsolete reads and release failed or late HTTP response bodies.",
    "Share GLB/glTF parser cancellation and dispose all late scenes, deduplicating shared geometry/material/texture resources.",
    "Stop waiting for STEP initialization without cancelling its shared promise; check cancellation before expensive stale ReadStepFile conversion. Failed initialization remains retryable.",
    "Cancel 3MF ZIP indexing and per-model extraction waits, checking cancellation before parsing late XML.",
    "Add optional ModelLoadOptions with signal to public GLB, STEP and both 3MF loader APIs; preserve existing one-argument behavior and exact synchronous native-input snapshots."
  ],
